GBPRIME_MINISTERPrime Ministerordinal of the person by first appointment; a person who served non-consecutive terms has one line per term and keeps the same number on eachJPPRIME_MINISTER内閣総理大臣代, one per appointment; a cabinet re-formed after a general election starts a new 代, so a person keeps one line per 代 with a new number on eachKRPRESIDENT대통령대, one per election; a person re-elected keeps one line per term with consecutive numbersUSPRESIDENTPresidentpresidency number, one per non-consecutive presidency; a person returning after an absence gets a new number